    "id": 3516788,
    "postDate": "2026-08-25T10:41:05.113Z",
    "rawMarkdown": "Yes, I experienced exactly the same issue with exactly those two DICOM files. Both files contain Pixel Data that is exactly half the size expected from their DICOM metadata, so this appears to be an issue in the distributed dataset rather than a failed download. Redownloading is therefore unlikely to fix these two files. ",
    "content": "<p>Yes, I experienced exactly the same issue with exactly those two DICOM files. Both files contain Pixel Data that is exactly half the size expected from their DICOM metadata, so this appears to be an issue in the distributed dataset rather than a failed download. Redownloading is therefore unlikely to fix these two files. </p>",
